concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-8f a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8F Meaning of approved auditor"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-8f ;
    values:originalText "(1) A reference in this Part to an approved auditor is a reference to a person included in a class of persons specified in a written determination made by the ACA for the purposes of this section.  (2) A copy of the determination must be published in the Gazette." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A reference in this Part to an approved auditor is a reference to a person included in a class of persons specified in a written determination made by the ACA for the purposes of this section.  (2) A copy of the determination must be published in the Gazette."@en ;
