    cof:title "9A(3) Determinations of what is necessary to ensure reasonable" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Minister may determine in writing, for the purpose of paragraph 9(1)(c), what is, or is not, necessary to ensure that prescribed carriage services are reasonably accessible as mentioned in that paragraph." ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer .

