doc:sch-1-sec-9f a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "9F Supply of prescribed carriage services" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "A reference in this Part to the supply of a prescribed carriage service includes a reference to the supply of:  (a) customer equipment of a kind specified in the regulations; and  (b) other goods of a kind specified in the regulations; and  (c) services of a kind specified in the regulations; where the equipment, goods or services, as the case may be, are for use in connection with the prescribed carriage service. Subdivision B—Universal service areas" ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-9g a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9G Universal service areas"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-9g ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may make a written determination that a service area, determined in any way the Minister considers appropriate, is a universal service area in respect of one or more specified service obligations.  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may make a written determination that a service area, determined in any way the Minister considers appropriate, is a universal service area in respect of one or more specified service obligations.  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "07f4f0ad4ad4300590f21209cae1c9ca7c6c5674262079ac2beeb4fff76fbf9d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Minister may make a written determination about universal service areas." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
