concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-9h a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9H Effect of determination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-9h ;
    values:originalText "(1) A determination under section 9G takes effect on the day specified in the determination. That day must not be before the day on which notice of the determination is published in the Gazette.  (2) If the determination is expressed to cease to have effect at a specified time, the determination ceases to have effect at that time.  (3) A variation or revocation of a determination under section 9G takes effect on the day specified for the purpose in the instrument of  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            13 variation or revocation. That day must not be before notice of the instrument is published in the Gazette." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A determination under section 9G takes effect on the day specified in the determination. That day must not be before the day on which notice of the determination is published in the Gazette.  (2) If the determination is expressed to cease to have effect at a specified time, the determination ceases to have effect at that time.  (3) A variation or revocation of a determination under section 9G takes effect on the day specified for the purpose in the instrument of  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            13 variation or revocation. That day must not be before notice of the instrument is published in the Gazette."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ead35818896bbadff9f88e2931fef3db93a05f1c1cce3350dbf778d7cc5bfec8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-9h-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-9h-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-9h-ss-3 ;
