concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-9j a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9J Transitional arrangements may be determined"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-9j ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the Minister revokes a determination under section 9G, the Minister may determine in writing arrangements to deal with any issues of a transitional nature that may arise as a result of the revocation.  (2) A copy of a determination under subsection (1) must be published in the Gazette." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If the Minister revokes a determination under section 9G, the Minister may determine in writing arrangements to deal with any issues of a transitional nature that may arise as a result of the revocation.  (2) A copy of a determination under subsection (1) must be published in the Gazette."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "564ef9dc3c04513c1f362bacea54f735eb2e79dd0505e04e878bdd9b296f5c71" ;
    cof:pageNumber "17"^^xsd:integer ;
