concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10A General digital data service obligation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-10a ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Act, the general digital data service obligation is the obligation to ensure that general digital data services are reasonably accessible to all people in general digital data service areas on an equitable basis.  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999" ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Act, the general digital data service obligation is the obligation to ensure that general digital data services are reasonably accessible to all people in general digital data service areas on an equitable basis.  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999"@en ;
