concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-16 ;
    values:originalText "(No. 2) 2000       No. 142, 2000  (a) immediately before 1 July 1997, Telstra supplied a basic rate Integrated Services Digital Network (ISDN) service; and  (b) the service complied with any of the standards for ISDN services made by the European Telecommunications Standards Institute (ETSI); the service is a designated basic rate ISDN service. Comparability of digital data capability  (5) For the purposes of subsection (2), the determination of the comparability of the digital data capability of a carriage service is to be based solely on a comparison of the data transmission speed available to an end-user of the service." ;
    skos:definition "(No. 2) 2000       No. 142, 2000  (a) immediately before 1 July 1997, Telstra supplied a basic rate Integrated Services Digital Network (ISDN) service; and  (b) the service complied with any of the standards for ISDN services made by the European Telecommunications Standards Institute (ETSI); the service is a designated basic rate ISDN service. Comparability of digital data capability  (5) For the purposes of subsection (2), the determination of the comparability of the digital data capability of a carriage service is to be based solely on a comparison of the data transmission speed available to an end-user of the service."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "856f9591245e72d33c77c2e36c27e4e9f17fa44f828692e51417eaa8472fde1f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Telstra must supply a basic rate ISDN service that complies with ETSI standards." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.20" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16-norm .
