doc:sch-1-sec-10f-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10F(2) Supply of general digital data services" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Regulations made for the purposes of paragraph (1)(e) may require that the supply of a specified kind of customer equipment is to be by way of hire. If those regulations impose such a requirement, this Part has effect, in relation to the customer equipment concerned, as if a reference to supply were a reference to supply by way of hire." ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10f-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10F(3) Supply of general digital data services"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-10f-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Regulations made for the purposes of paragraph (1)(e) may require that specified customer equipment is to be supplied on the basis that the customer concerned enters into a legally enforceable agreement containing such terms and conditions relating to the ownership, possession, location, disposal or use of the equipment, as are specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, the regulations.  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            17" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Regulations made for the purposes of paragraph (1)(e) may require that specified customer equipment is to be supplied on the basis that the customer concerned enters into a legally enforceable agreement containing such terms and conditions relating to the ownership, possession, location, disposal or use of the equipment, as are specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, the regulations.  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            17"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "20404c69a5ffbf3a668363e59ac2c5e1d7d0f789391afe80225112f5e156548d" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10f ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Customer equipment must be supplied under a legally enforceable agreement." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
