doc:sch-1-sec-10g-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10G(2) Supply of special digital data services" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Regulations made for the purposes of paragraph (1)(e) may require that the supply of a specified kind of customer equipment is to be by way of hire. If those regulations impose such a requirement, this Part has effect, in relation to the customer equipment concerned, as if a reference to supply were a reference to supply by way of hire." ;
    cof:pageNumber "21"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10g-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10G(3) Supply of special digital data services"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-10g-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Regulations made for the purposes of paragraph (1)(e) may require that specified customer equipment is to be supplied on the basis that the customer concerned enters into a legally enforceable agreement containing such terms and conditions relating to the ownership, possession, location, disposal or use of the equipment, as are specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, the regulations." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Regulations made for the purposes of paragraph (1)(e) may require that specified customer equipment is to be supplied on the basis that the customer concerned enters into a legally enforceable agreement containing such terms and conditions relating to the ownership, possession, location, disposal or use of the equipment, as are specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, the regulations."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7a1c5d10eee65ef3a164b68f94b26a67e7dceb96edb6a630b5b830dfdec7fe9c" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10g ;
    cof:pageNumber "21"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Customer equipment must be supplied under a legally enforceable agreement." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf> ;
