concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10j a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10J Special digital data service areas"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-10j ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may make a written determination that a service area ascertained in accordance with the determination is a special digital data service area for the purposes of this Act. The determination has effect accordingly.  (2) A copy of the determination must be published in the Gazette.  (3) The Minister must exercise the powers conferred by this section in a manner that is consistent with the fulfilment of the digital data service obligation." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may make a written determination that a service area ascertained in accordance with the determination is a special digital data service area for the purposes of this Act. The determination has effect accordingly.  (2) A copy of the determination must be published in the Gazette.  (3) The Minister must exercise the powers conferred by this section in a manner that is consistent with the fulfilment of the digital data service obligation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2b5878efa046b5c76f2d158a48b2d936cf651c1f6df86f09d37db067057eb161" ;
