on in doing a specified thing that the person is or will be required or permitted to do by or under a provision of this Part. The determination has effect accordingly.  (6A) If a former provider has been given notice of a requirement under subsection (3), the ACA may, in writing, direct the former provider to comply with the requirement or with specified aspects of the requirement. The former provider must comply with the direction.  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999" ;
