doc:sch-1-sec-20-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20(5) Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) If a requirement made by a notice under subsection (3) is reasonable, the former provider must comply with the requirement as soon as practicable after receiving the notice. However, if the requirement is unreasonable, the former provider does not have to comply with it." ;
