concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22 Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-22 ;
    values:originalText "(No. 2) 2000       No. 142, 2000  (6B) In deciding whether to give a direction under subsection (6A), the ACA must consider whether the requirement under subsection (3) is reasonable.  (7) A determination under subsection (6) is a disallowable instrument for the purposes of section 46A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    skos:definition "(No. 2) 2000       No. 142, 2000  (6B) In deciding whether to give a direction under subsection (6A), the ACA must consider whether the requirement under subsection (3) is reasonable.  (7) A determination under subsection (6) is a disallowable instrument for the purposes of section 46A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "979e11152bb97086837bd46c20185accb794ccfc420df3c8dfc17f4413c44d83" ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer ;
