concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12a-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12A(6) Determination of primary universal service providers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12a-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) A determination under this section is a disallowable instrument for the purposes of section 46A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901. Note: A determination that the Minister is taken to have made under this section because of section 12D or 12E is not a disallowable instrument (see subsections 12D(2) and 12E(6)).  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            25" ;
