concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12B Effect of determination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12b ;
    values:originalText "(1) A determination under section 12A takes effect on the day specified in the determination. That day must not be before the day on which notice of the determination is published in the Gazette.  (2) If such a determination is expressed to cease to have effect at a specified time, the determination ceases to have effect at that time.  (3) A variation or revocation of a determination under section 12A takes effect on the day specified for the purpose in the instrument of variation or revocation. That day must not be before notice of the instrument is published in the Gazette.  (4) If the Minister revokes a determination under section 12A, the Minister may determine in writing arrangements to deal with any issues of a transitional nature that may arise as a result of the revocation.  (5) A copy of a determination under subsection (4) must be published in the Gazette." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A determination under section 12A takes effect on the day specified in the determination. That day must not be before the day on which notice of the determination is published in the Gazette.  (2) If such a determination is expressed to cease to have effect at a specified time, the determination ceases to have effect at that time.  (3) A variation or revocation of a determination under section 12A takes effect on the day specified for the purpose in the instrument of variation or revocation. That day must not be before notice of the instrument is published in the Gazette.  (4) If the Minister revokes a determination under section 12A, the Minister may determine in writing arrangements to deal with any issues of a transitional nature that may arise as a result of the revocation.  (5) A copy of a determination under subsection (4) must be published in the Gazette."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c2295f69b040821b51ee3245932fa2f6fc4190f0f65243939c940d0470b37868" ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12b-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12b-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12b-ss-3 ;
