doc:sch-1-sec-12j-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "12J(1) Public consultation required on draft policy statement and draft" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Before giving the ACA a draft policy statement or draft standard marketing plan, a primary universal service provider must:  (a) publish a preliminary version of the draft and invite members of the public to make submissions to the provider about the preliminary version within a specified period (which must be at least 30 days); and  (b) give consideration to any submissions received from members of the public within that period." ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12j-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12J(2) Public consultation required on draft policy statement and draft"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12j-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) When giving the draft to the ACA, the provider must include advice on the submissions considered and any changes made to the draft as a result.  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            31" ;
    skos:definition "(2) When giving the draft to the ACA, the provider must include advice on the submissions considered and any changes made to the draft as a result.  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            31"@en ;
