doc:sch-1-sec-12j-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "12J(2) Public consultation required on draft policy statement and draft" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) When giving the draft to the ACA, the provider must include advice on the submissions considered and any changes made to the draft as a result.  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            31" ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12j-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12J(3) Public consultation required on draft policy statement and draft"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12j-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) However, this section does not apply to a fresh draft policy statement, or fresh draft standard marketing plan, given to the ACA by a primary universal service provider in accordance with a direction under paragraph 12M(2)(b) unless the ACA notifies the provider in writing that it does apply to the document." ;
    skos:definition "(3) However, this section does not apply to a fresh draft policy statement, or fresh draft standard marketing plan, given to the ACA by a primary universal service provider in accordance with a direction under paragraph 12M(2)(b) unless the ACA notifies the provider in writing that it does apply to the document."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d76c7cf76e9dce4fe7b74ddc59ebd9d96425d991da2e685f8d9c038ef027de00" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12j ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Public consultation required for certain policy statements and marketing plans." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
