doc:sch-1-sec-12p-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "12P(2) Meaning of expressions" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A draft ATS marketing plan that has been approved by the ACA under section 12T, and that is in force, is an approved ATS marketing plan for the primary universal service provider concerned." ;
    cof:pageNumber "37"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12p-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12P(3) Meaning of expressions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12p-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Each draft or approved ATS marketing plan must cover only one universal service area and only one service obligation. However, the ACA may determine in writing that this subsection does not apply to:  (a) draft or approved ATS marketing plans generally; or  (b) a draft or approved ATS marketing plan of a particular primary universal service provider." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Each draft or approved ATS marketing plan must cover only one universal service area and only one service obligation. However, the ACA may determine in writing that this subsection does not apply to:  (a) draft or approved ATS marketing plans generally; or  (b) a draft or approved ATS marketing plan of a particular primary universal service provider."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a665e71aaae79f4f9618cc7de7b48d5db4373df448b473ebdabe2111d5f6684d" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12p ;
    cof:pageNumber "37"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Each draft or approved ATS marketing plan must cover only one universal service area and one service obligation." ;
