concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12v a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12V Replacement of approved policy statement, approved standard"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12v ;
    values:originalText "marketing plan or approved ATS marketing plan  (1) An approved policy statement for a primary universal service provider ceases to be in force if a later draft policy statement, that is expressed to replace it, becomes an approved policy statement.  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            37  (2) An approved standard marketing plan for a primary universal service provider ceases to be in force if a later draft standard marketing plan, that is expressed to replace it, becomes an approved standard marketing plan.  (3) An approved ATS marketing plan for a primary universal service provider ceases to be in force if a later draft ATS marketing plan, that is expressed to replace it, becomes an approved ATS marketing plan." ;
    skos:definition "marketing plan or approved ATS marketing plan  (1) An approved policy statement for a primary universal service provider ceases to be in force if a later draft policy statement, that is expressed to replace it, becomes an approved policy statement.  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            37  (2) An approved standard marketing plan for a primary universal service provider ceases to be in force if a later draft standard marketing plan, that is expressed to replace it, becomes an approved standard marketing plan.  (3) An approved ATS marketing plan for a primary universal service provider ceases to be in force if a later draft ATS marketing plan, that is expressed to replace it, becomes an approved ATS marketing plan."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "669de56158c34ccc1a4c6a047420e99252318118d4ee37a4a7de8edcda59f9d7" ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12v-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12v-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12v-ss-3 ;
