concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12w-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12W(3) Variation of approved policy statement, approved standard"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12w-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Before deciding whether to approve the variation, the ACA may, if the ACA considers it appropriate, require the provider:  (a) to publish a preliminary version of the draft variation and invite members of the public to make submissions to the provider about the preliminary version within a specified period; and  (b) to give consideration to any submissions from members of the public received within that period; and  (c) to advise the ACA on those submissions and any changes made to the draft variation as a result." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Before deciding whether to approve the variation, the ACA may, if the ACA considers it appropriate, require the provider:  (a) to publish a preliminary version of the draft variation and invite members of the public to make submissions to the provider about the preliminary version within a specified period; and  (b) to give consideration to any submissions from members of the public received within that period; and  (c) to advise the ACA on those submissions and any changes made to the draft variation as a result."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "180a65c115a5b2668fb33734ed8ee0e88acc4f780c8a548293bf2dda5fa0071f" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12w ;
    cof:pageNumber "41"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Provider must consider public submissions before advising ACA on draft variation." ;
    dc:description "Submissions from members of the public" ;
