concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12w-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12W(4) Variation of approved policy statement, approved standard"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12w-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The ACA must not approve the variation unless it is satisfied that:  (a) in the case of a draft variation of an approved policy statement—if the provider were to give the ACA a draft  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999" ;
