concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12z-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12Z(4) Minister may revoke approved ATS marketing plan"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12z-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Minister may determine in writing arrangements to deal with issues of a transitional nature that may arise as a result of the revocation. A copy of the determination must be:  (a) given to the provider; and  (b) published in the Gazette." ;
