doc:sch-1-sec-13v-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "13V(1) Minister may revoke approved ATS marketing plan" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by giving written notice to a competing universal service provider, revoke the provider’s approved ATS  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            53 marketing plan if the Minister considers that it is in the public interest to do so. A copy of the notice must be given to the ACA." ;
    cof:pageNumber "56"^^xsd:integer .

