doc:sch-1-sec-14a-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "14A(3) Effect of determination" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A variation or revocation of a determination under section 14 takes effect on the day specified for the purpose in the instrument of variation or revocation. That day must not be before notice of the instrument is published in the Gazette." ;
