concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-14a-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "14A(4) Effect of determination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-14a-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the Minister revokes a determination under section 14, the Minister may determine in writing arrangements to deal with any issues of a transitional nature that may arise as a result of the revocation." ;
