    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if:  (a) the Minister determines under section 15 that a carrier or carriage service provider (the current provider) is a digital data service provider for a particular area (the relevant area); and  (b) another person, who is or was a digital data service provider for some or all of the relevant area, is determined to be a former provider under subsection (4)." ;
