concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-15b-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15B(2) Former digital data service provider may be required to"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-15b-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) This section also applies if:  (a) either:  (i) the Minister revokes or varies a determination under section 15 so that a person (the former provider) ceases to be a digital data service provider for a digital data service area (the relevant area); or  (ii) a person otherwise ceases to be a digital data service provider for a particular area (the relevant area); and  (b) a person (the current provider), who was also a digital data service provider for some or all of the relevant area, continues to be a digital data service provider for some or all of the area:  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            57  (i) if subparagraph (a)(i) applies—after the revocation or variation; or  (ii) if subparagraph (a)(ii) applies—after the cessation." ;
    skos:definition "(2) This section also applies if:  (a) either:  (i) the Minister revokes or varies a determination under section 15 so that a person (the former provider) ceases to be a digital data service provider for a digital data service area (the relevant area); or  (ii) a person otherwise ceases to be a digital data service provider for a particular area (the relevant area); and  (b) a person (the current provider), who was also a digital data service provider for some or all of the relevant area, continues to be a digital data service provider for some or all of the area:  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            57  (i) if subparagraph (a)(i) applies—after the revocation or variation; or  (ii) if subparagraph (a)(ii) applies—after the cessation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d4a7afca7f9ff340078565189326df4846f24a4379728c8391135efc59299de5" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-15b ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A person must continue to be a digital data service provider for some or all of the area after certain events." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
