doc:sch-1-sec-15b-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15B(4) Former digital data service provider may be required to" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Minister may determine in writing that a person is a former provider for the purposes of this section." ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-15b-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15B(5) Former digital data service provider may be required to"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-15b-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The current provider may, by written notice given to the former provider, require the former provider to give to the current provider specified information of the kind referred to in subsection (6). A notice of this kind cannot be given more than 6 months after:  (a) if subsection (1) applies—the later of the following days:  (i) the day on which the current provider became a digital data service provider for the relevant area; or  (ii) the day on which the determination under subsection 15(1) or (2) was made in respect of the current provider; or  (b) if subsection (2) applies—the day on which the former provider ceases to be a digital data service provider for the relevant area." ;
    skos:definition "(5) The current provider may, by written notice given to the former provider, require the former provider to give to the current provider specified information of the kind referred to in subsection (6). A notice of this kind cannot be given more than 6 months after:  (a) if subsection (1) applies—the later of the following days:  (i) the day on which the current provider became a digital data service provider for the relevant area; or  (ii) the day on which the determination under subsection 15(1) or (2) was made in respect of the current provider; or  (b) if subsection (2) applies—the day on which the former provider ceases to be a digital data service provider for the relevant area."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ccb6e49e2a28a5baeacfa5f03b23d15905a0a8ba3a6a988013be033335845513" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-15b ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Current provider may require former provider to provide specified information." ;
    dc:description "true" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
