concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-15g a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15G Public consultation—draft plan"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-15g ;
    values:originalText "(1) Before giving the Minister a draft digital data service plan under section 15F, a digital data service provider must:  (a) publish a preliminary version of the draft plan and invite members of the public to make submissions to the provider about the preliminary version within a specified period; and  (b) give consideration to any submissions received from members of the public within that period.  (2) The period specified in the invitation must run for at least 30 days.  (3) This section does not apply to a draft plan given to the Minister in accordance with a direction under subsection 15F(3).  (4) This section does not apply to a draft plan given to the Minister in accordance with a notice under paragraph 15N(2)(b).  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Before giving the Minister a draft digital data service plan under section 15F, a digital data service provider must:  (a) publish a preliminary version of the draft plan and invite members of the public to make submissions to the provider about the preliminary version within a specified period; and  (b) give consideration to any submissions received from members of the public within that period.  (2) The period specified in the invitation must run for at least 30 days.  (3) This section does not apply to a draft plan given to the Minister in accordance with a direction under subsection 15F(3).  (4) This section does not apply to a draft plan given to the Minister in accordance with a notice under paragraph 15N(2)(b).  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "51d2c14145407f8e697a674574c9e15ea631f2c0bb7e9daeec0e3c6beb13c6c6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "63"^^xsd:integer ;
