concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-15h a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15H Minister to have regard to certain matters"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-15h ;
    values:originalText "(1) In deciding whether to approve a draft digital data service plan for a general digital data service area or a special digital data service area, the Minister must have regard to whether:  (a) the draft plan provides for the general digital data service obligation, or special digital data service obligation, (so far as it relates to that area) to be fulfilled:  (i) as efficiently and economically as practicable; and  (ii) at performance standards that reasonably meet the social, industrial and commercial needs of the Australian community; and  (iii) progressively throughout that area within such period as the Minister considers reasonable; and  (aa) the draft plan addresses the needs of people with a disability; and  (b) the draft plan complies with any requirements in force under section 15J.  (2) Subsection (1) does not, by implication, limit the matters to which regard may be had." ;
    skos:definition "(1) In deciding whether to approve a draft digital data service plan for a general digital data service area or a special digital data service area, the Minister must have regard to whether:  (a) the draft plan provides for the general digital data service obligation, or special digital data service obligation, (so far as it relates to that area) to be fulfilled:  (i) as efficiently and economically as practicable; and  (ii) at performance standards that reasonably meet the social, industrial and commercial needs of the Australian community; and  (iii) progressively throughout that area within such period as the Minister considers reasonable; and  (aa) the draft plan addresses the needs of people with a disability; and  (b) the draft plan complies with any requirements in force under section 15J.  (2) Subsection (1) does not, by implication, limit the matters to which regard may be had."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "16ba55d71067c7abef9a5a5f83e9e7b5b4b50808f26da152ce421e26c35e44af" ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-15h-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-15h-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.64" .
