concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-15p a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15P Compliance with approved digital data service plan"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-15p ;
    values:originalText "If an approved digital data service plan is in force, the general digital data service provider, or special digital data service provider, concerned must take all reasonable steps to ensure that the plan is complied with." ;
    skos:definition "If an approved digital data service plan is in force, the general digital data service provider, or special digital data service provider, concerned must take all reasonable steps to ensure that the plan is complied with."@en ;
