concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16B Effect of the determination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-16b ;
    values:originalText "(1) A determination under section 16 takes effect on the day specified in the determination (which may be before, on or after the day on which the determination is made).  (2) A determination under section 16 applies for the period specified in the determination, which must not be longer than 3 years.  (3) A variation or revocation of such a determination takes effect on the day specified for the purpose in the instrument of variation or revocation (which may be before, on or after the day on which the instrument is made)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A determination under section 16 takes effect on the day specified in the determination (which may be before, on or after the day on which the determination is made).  (2) A determination under section 16 applies for the period specified in the determination, which must not be longer than 3 years.  (3) A variation or revocation of such a determination takes effect on the day specified for the purpose in the instrument of variation or revocation (which may be before, on or after the day on which the instrument is made)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "32bf2a0c72e2a248c3fb6daa54c849bc0046048de512a0ee4229a0e74be685aa" ;
    cof:pageNumber "68"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16b-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16b-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16b-ss-3 ;
