concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-19 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19 Digital data service charges"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-19 ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Division, if a person is a general digital data service provider for a particular area, a digital data service charge is a charge imposed, or proposed to be imposed, by the  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            69 person for the supply of general digital data services to persons in the area.  (2) For the purposes of this Division, if a person is a special digital data service provider for a particular area, a digital data service charge is a charge imposed, or proposed to be imposed, by the person for the supply of special digital data services to persons in the area." ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Division, if a person is a general digital data service provider for a particular area, a digital data service charge is a charge imposed, or proposed to be imposed, by the  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            69 person for the supply of general digital data services to persons in the area.  (2) For the purposes of this Division, if a person is a special digital data service provider for a particular area, a digital data service charge is a charge imposed, or proposed to be imposed, by the person for the supply of special digital data services to persons in the area."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "edc4c1430a78b78545009fb976a09a1c79c632899ecbb2044b3d5a322c5ea765" ;
    cof:pageNumber "72"^^xsd:integer ;
