concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-19a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19A Determination subjecting digital data service charges to price"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-19a ;
    values:originalText "control arrangements  (1) The Minister may, by notice published in the Gazette, determine that specified digital data service charges are subject to price control arrangements under this Division.  (2) A determination under subsection (1) is a disallowable instrument for the purposes of section 46A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    skos:definition "control arrangements  (1) The Minister may, by notice published in the Gazette, determine that specified digital data service charges are subject to price control arrangements under this Division.  (2) A determination under subsection (1) is a disallowable instrument for the purposes of section 46A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."@en ;
