concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-19b-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19B(4) Price control determinations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-19b-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A determination under subsection (2) may make different provision with respect to different customers. This section does not, by implication, limit subsection 33(3A) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
