concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20A Who is a participating person?"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20a ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a person is a participating person for an eligible revenue period if:  (a) the person was a carrier at any time during the eligible revenue period; or  (b) the Minister makes a written determination that carriage service providers are participating persons for the eligible revenue period and the person was a carriage service provider at any time during the eligible revenue period.  (2) However, a person is not a participating person for an eligible revenue period if:  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999" ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a person is a participating person for an eligible revenue period if:  (a) the person was a carrier at any time during the eligible revenue period; or  (b) the Minister makes a written determination that carriage service providers are participating persons for the eligible revenue period and the person was a carriage service provider at any time during the eligible revenue period.  (2) However, a person is not a participating person for an eligible revenue period if:  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6fd3f4676aa65be2576cff51d0201c5de34943cb0f6b3787b60a8d0d987c9891" ;
    cof:pageNumber "75"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20a-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
