    cof:title "20A(1) Who is a participating person?" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a person is a participating person for an eligible revenue period if:  (a) the person was a carrier at any time during the eligible revenue period; or  (b) the Minister makes a written determination that carriage service providers are participating persons for the eligible revenue period and the person was a carriage service provider at any time during the eligible revenue period." ;
    cof:pageNumber "75"^^xsd:integer .

