    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20a-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, a person is not a participating person for an eligible revenue period if:  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999" ;
