doc:sch-1-sec-20f-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20F(2) ACA to assess eligible revenue" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person’s eligible revenue:  (a) must be assessed as zero if the person’s eligible revenue is less than the amount (the threshold amount) determined in writing by the Minister for the purposes of this subsection; or  (b) in any other case—must be reduced by the threshold amount." ;
