concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20l a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20L ACA to publish claims or a summary of claims"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20l ;
    values:originalText "(1) Within 14 days after the end of the period for making claims for levy credit for a claim period, the ACA must publish on the Internet or by any other means that the ACA considers appropriate:  (a) a copy of each claim made under section 20J in respect of the claim period; or  (b) a summary of all the claims made under that section in respect of the claim period.  (2) In this section: claim includes a variation of a claim." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Within 14 days after the end of the period for making claims for levy credit for a claim period, the ACA must publish on the Internet or by any other means that the ACA considers appropriate:  (a) a copy of each claim made under section 20J in respect of the claim period; or  (b) a summary of all the claims made under that section in respect of the claim period.  (2) In this section: claim includes a variation of a claim."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fea66c091b3ccaed9a4b32def4d36cd87cba08345d85c566bee6193a70c29604" ;
    cof:pageNumber "81"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20l-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20l-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
