concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20n a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20N ACA to assess levy credit"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20n ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACA must make a written assessment, in respect of each person who submits a claim for levy credit for a claim period in accordance with section 20J, of the person’s levy credit for that period. Note: The assessment may be included in the same document as any other assessment the ACA makes under this Part (see section 20Y).  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ACA must make a written assessment, in respect of each person who submits a claim for levy credit for a claim period in accordance with section 20J, of the person’s levy credit for that period. Note: The assessment may be included in the same document as any other assessment the ACA makes under this Part (see section 20Y).  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "520b3ec6d4841765667d1c5edb50c83ea0d13b65654ec98164f57bd0c2dfc87d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "81"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "ACA must make a written assessment of levy credit for each person submitting a claim." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.81" ;
