rt of the claim period; and  (c) any other information or documents that the ACA has and that it thinks relevant to making the assessment.  (6) The ACA must act expeditiously in preparing its assessment. However, a failure to comply with this subsection does not affect the validity of the assessment." ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer .

