doc:sch-1-sec-20u-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20U(1) ACA to make written assessment" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) For each claim period, the ACA must make a written assessment setting out:  (a) the matters in subsections (2), (3) and (4); and  (b) the total of all levy credits to which persons are entitled for the claim period." ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20u-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20U(2) ACA to make written assessment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20u-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) For each participating person for the last eligible revenue period that ended before the start of the claim period, the assessment must set out:  (a) the person’s levy debit under section 20R for the claim period; and  (b) the person’s levy debit balance (if any) under section 20S for the claim period; and  (c) if the person has a levy debit balance—the levy payable by the person on that balance. Note: Section 20Z sets out when the levy is payable." ;
    skos:definition "(2) For each participating person for the last eligible revenue period that ended before the start of the claim period, the assessment must set out:  (a) the person’s levy debit under section 20R for the claim period; and  (b) the person’s levy debit balance (if any) under section 20S for the claim period; and  (c) if the person has a levy debit balance—the levy payable by the person on that balance. Note: Section 20Z sets out when the levy is payable."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f7865b1075fb2edffb8004b543a77abd37c20683acee5524151492ecd95b5268" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20u ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Assessment must provide levy debit and balance information" ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
