concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20u-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20U(4) ACA to make written assessment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20u-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For each digital data service provider for the claim period, the assessment must set out:  (a) the provider’s digital data cost for the claim period; and  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            81  (b) the provider’s levy credit balance (if any) under section 20T for the claim period; and  (c) if the provider has a levy credit balance—the amount payable to the provider under section 21C for the claim period." ;
    skos:definition "(4) For each digital data service provider for the claim period, the assessment must set out:  (a) the provider’s digital data cost for the claim period; and  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            81  (b) the provider’s levy credit balance (if any) under section 20T for the claim period; and  (c) if the provider has a levy credit balance—the amount payable to the provider under section 21C for the claim period."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c0a410dd52c66e6e0dc914996b2a68e11f427a63f8d276cc19a93ad65f09fd85" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20u ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Digital data service provider must provide written assessment with specific details." ;
    dc:description "True" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
