doc:sch-1-sec-20u-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20U(4) ACA to make written assessment" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) For each digital data service provider for the claim period, the assessment must set out:  (a) the provider’s digital data cost for the claim period; and  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            81  (b) the provider’s levy credit balance (if any) under section 20T for the claim period; and  (c) if the provider has a levy credit balance—the amount payable to the provider under section 21C for the claim period." ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20u-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20U(5) ACA to make written assessment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20u-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The assessment must be made on the basis of:  (a) the assessments under section 20N of levy credits for the claim period; and  (b) the assessments under section 20F of eligible revenue for each participating person for the last eligible revenue period that ended before the start of the claim period; and  (c) any other information or documents that the ACA has and that it thinks relevant to making the assessment." ;
    skos:definition "(5) The assessment must be made on the basis of:  (a) the assessments under section 20N of levy credits for the claim period; and  (b) the assessments under section 20F of eligible revenue for each participating person for the last eligible revenue period that ended before the start of the claim period; and  (c) any other information or documents that the ACA has and that it thinks relevant to making the assessment."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d8f84609b870c5e071e38ee46b9b152306e41aacdb37c90415af0d1ab5cf626e" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20u ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Assessment must be made based on specific information and documents." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
