concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20u-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20U(6) ACA to make written assessment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20u-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) The ACA must act expeditiously in preparing its assessment. However, a failure to comply with this subsection does not affect the validity of the assessment." ;
    skos:definition "(6) The ACA must act expeditiously in preparing its assessment. However, a failure to comply with this subsection does not affect the validity of the assessment."@en ;
