doc:sch-1-sec-20v a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20V Publication of assessment" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "As soon as practicable after making an assessment under section 20U for a claim period, the ACA must:  (a) cause a copy of the assessment to be published in the Gazette; and  (b) give a copy of the assessment to each of the persons referred to in subsections 20U(2), (3) and (4)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "85"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20w a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20W Variation of assessments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20w ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACA may vary an assessment made under this Part by making such alterations and additions as it thinks necessary, even if levy credits or levy has been paid in respect of an assessment.  (2) Unless the contrary intention appears, an amended assessment is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be an assessment under section 20F, 20N or 20U (as the case may be)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ACA may vary an assessment made under this Part by making such alterations and additions as it thinks necessary, even if levy credits or levy has been paid in respect of an assessment.  (2) Unless the contrary intention appears, an amended assessment is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be an assessment under section 20F, 20N or 20U (as the case may be)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0da8368179af36ad0bec7adc333d7c271958beb781db0cac247d9c2a02cbf7ef" ;
    cof:pageNumber "85"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20w-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20w-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
