concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20y a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20Y Multiple assessments in the same document"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20y ;
    values:originalText "The ACA may include in the same document more than one assessment made under this Part. Subdivision D—Collection and recovery of levy 20Z  When levy payable  (1) Levy assessed under section 20U becomes due and payable on:  (a) the 28th day; or  (b) such later day as is determined in writing by the ACA; after the ACA gives a copy of the assessment to the participating person in respect of which the levy has been assessed.  (2) A copy of a determination under paragraph (1)(b) must be published in the Gazette." ;
    skos:definition "The ACA may include in the same document more than one assessment made under this Part. Subdivision D—Collection and recovery of levy 20Z  When levy payable  (1) Levy assessed under section 20U becomes due and payable on:  (a) the 28th day; or  (b) such later day as is determined in writing by the ACA; after the ACA gives a copy of the assessment to the participating person in respect of which the levy has been assessed.  (2) A copy of a determination under paragraph (1)(b) must be published in the Gazette."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4809e23d603e4e947009785f6c21c476d4505533677c8022aac19a5994be89f9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "86"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20y-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20y-ss-2 ;
