doc:sch-1-sec-20zb a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20ZB Validity of assessment" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The validity of an assessment under this Division is not affected by a contravention of this Act." ;
    cof:pageNumber "86"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20zc a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20ZC Evidence of assessment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20zc ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if:  (a) a copy of the Gazette is produced that sets out what purports to be a copy of an assessment made under section 20U; or  (b) a document that purports to be such a copy is produced.  (2) Except so far as the contrary is established, it must be presumed:  (a) that the copy of the Gazette sets out, or that the document is, as the case may be, a copy of such an assessment; and  (b) that the ACA has duly made the assessment; and  (c) that the amounts and other particulars set out in the assessment are correct.  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            83" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if:  (a) a copy of the Gazette is produced that sets out what purports to be a copy of an assessment made under section 20U; or  (b) a document that purports to be such a copy is produced.  (2) Except so far as the contrary is established, it must be presumed:  (a) that the copy of the Gazette sets out, or that the document is, as the case may be, a copy of such an assessment; and  (b) that the ACA has duly made the assessment; and  (c) that the amounts and other particulars set out in the assessment are correct.  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999  Schedule 1  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            83"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "452863b5c38902785857864b4ed12714c86c89a43302a6693035fb4191b40e55" ;
    cof:pageNumber "86"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20zc-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20zc-ss-2 ;
