concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20zd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20ZD Onus of establishing incorrectness of assessment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20zd ;
    values:originalText "In any proceeding, the onus of establishing that an assessment under section 20U is incorrect is on the party making that assertion." ;
    skos:definition "In any proceeding, the onus of establishing that an assessment under section 20U is incorrect is on the party making that assertion."@en ;
