concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20zf a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20ZF Cancellation of certain exemptions from levy"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20zf ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section cancels the effect of a provision of another Act that would have the effect of exempting a person from liability to pay levy.  (2) The cancellation does not apply if the provision of the other Act is enacted after the commencement of this section and refers specifically to levy imposed by the Telecommunications (Universal Service Levy) Act 1997." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section cancels the effect of a provision of another Act that would have the effect of exempting a person from liability to pay levy.  (2) The cancellation does not apply if the provision of the other Act is enacted after the commencement of this section and refers specifically to levy imposed by the Telecommunications (Universal Service Levy) Act 1997."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "630a4e4d89c4f17ae3b2bfcdbd0722223262d3147129e743a70c3d97befab880" ;
    cof:pageNumber "87"^^xsd:integer ;
