doc:sch-1-sec-21b-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "21B(2) Purposes of Universal Service Account" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(e), the Minister administering the Financial Management and Accountability Act 1997 may, from time to time, determine the amount of a reimbursement to be made to the Commonwealth in relation to a period on such basis as he or she thinks appropriate." ;
    cof:pageNumber "89"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-21b-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21B(3) Purposes of Universal Service Account"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-21b-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Despite subsection (2), the total of the amounts reimbursed under paragraph (1)(e) must not exceed the total of the amounts paid into the Universal Service Account under paragraph 21A(b) (including any interest earned on those amounts).  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Despite subsection (2), the total of the amounts reimbursed under paragraph (1)(e) must not exceed the total of the amounts paid into the Universal Service Account under paragraph 21A(b) (including any interest earned on those amounts).  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ffb135cc8cc430feb45fcf2bcdf3fa3c6da6aee8380d749fe7da330984200e9d" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-21b ;
    cof:pageNumber "89"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Total reimbursement amount must not exceed total payment into Universal Service Account." ;
