    values:originalText "(2) An eligible person may request the ACA to make available to it specified information or documents of a kind referred to in subsection 22(1) that subsection 22(3) prevents the ACA from making available to the eligible person under section 22." ;
    cof:pageNumber "92"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
