doc:sch-1-sec-22a-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "22A(5) Request for information that is unavailable under section 22" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) In determining the question referred to in paragraph (4)(b), the ACA must have regard to:  (a) whether any undertakings have been given under subsection (6) and, if so, the nature of those undertakings; and  (b) such other matters (if any) as the ACA considers relevant." ;
    cof:pageNumber "92"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22a-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22A(6) Request for information that is unavailable under section 22"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-22a-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of this section, a person may give the ACA a written undertaking that, if specified information, or the whole or a part of a specified document, is made available to the person under this section, the person will not disclose the information, or the contents of the document, except to one or more specified persons. Note: Information, documents or persons may be specified by name, by inclusion in a class or in any other way." ;
    skos:definition "(6) For the purposes of this section, a person may give the ACA a written undertaking that, if specified information, or the whole or a part of a specified document, is made available to the person under this section, the person will not disclose the information, or the contents of the document, except to one or more specified persons. Note: Information, documents or persons may be specified by name, by inclusion in a class or in any other way."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bf60bf1f587cc782bfd71452f49dd92e35db19919bd72f053329e4a32a9a4b00" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22a ;
    cof:pageNumber "92"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Granting permission to disclose information under certain conditions." ;
