concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22B How the ACA is to comply with a request"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-22b ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACA may comply with a request by a person under section 22 or 22A by:  (a) communicating information to the person in writing or in some other form; or  (b) making documents available for inspection by the person or by an employee, agent or professional adviser of the person; or  (c) giving to the person copies of, extracts from, or summaries of, documents.  (2) In this section: document includes a part of a document." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ACA may comply with a request by a person under section 22 or 22A by:  (a) communicating information to the person in writing or in some other form; or  (b) making documents available for inspection by the person or by an employee, agent or professional adviser of the person; or  (c) giving to the person copies of, extracts from, or summaries of, documents.  (2) In this section: document includes a part of a document."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e75d05f0e02a550d0c6ab46bbfd4c89617e60292d398dca5b9e2eb75e048a001" ;
    cof:pageNumber "94"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22b-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22b-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
