concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-23-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23(3) ACA must maintain Register/s"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-23-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person may, on payment of the charge (if any) fixed by a determination under section 53 of the Australian Communications Authority Act 1997:  (a) inspect the Register or Registers; and  (b) make a copy of, or take extracts from, the Register or Registers." ;
    skos:definition "(3) A person may, on payment of the charge (if any) fixed by a determination under section 53 of the Australian Communications Authority Act 1997:  (a) inspect the Register or Registers; and  (b) make a copy of, or take extracts from, the Register or Registers."@en ;
