concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-23-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23(4) ACA must maintain Register/s"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-23-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of this section, if a Register is maintained by electronic means, a person is taken to have made a copy of, or taken an extract from, the Register if the ACA gives the person a printout of some or all of the Register." ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purposes of this section, if a Register is maintained by electronic means, a person is taken to have made a copy of, or taken an extract from, the Register if the ACA gives the person a printout of some or all of the Register."@en ;
