concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-23-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23(5) ACA must maintain Register/s"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-23-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If a person requests that a copy be provided in an electronic form, the ACA may provide the relevant information:  (a) on a data processing device; or  (b) by way of electronic transmission.  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999" ;
    skos:definition "(5) If a person requests that a copy be provided in an electronic form, the ACA may provide the relevant information:  (a) on a data processing device; or  (b) by way of electronic transmission.  Schedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999"@en ;
