concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-23b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23B Effect of failure to publish notices in the Gazette"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-23b ;
    values:originalText "A failure by the Minister or the ACA to publish a notice in the Gazette as required by a provision of this Act does not affect the validity of anything else done in accordance with this Act." ;
    skos:definition "A failure by the Minister or the ACA to publish a notice in the Gazette as required by a provision of this Act does not affect the validity of anything else done in accordance with this Act."@en ;
