    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-23d-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) A determination made for the purposes of subsection (2) is a disallowable instrument for the purposes of section 46A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  Schedule 2  Application and transitional provisions" ;
