concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-2-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Transitional regulations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "The Governor-General may make regulations in relation to any matters of a transitional nature that may arise out of the amendments and repeals made by this Act.  Consequential and other amendments  Schedule 3  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            99" ;
