concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-3-sec-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-7 ;
    values:originalText "Despite the repeal and substitution of subsection 2(2) of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999 made by item 6, that subsection continues to apply, after this item commences in relation to the financial year that ended on 30 June 2000, as if that repeal and substitution had not happened." ;
