concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-3-sec-14 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "14 After subsection 107(6)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-14 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (6A) However, subsection (6) does not apply if obligations arising under one or any combination of the following:  (a) one or more agreements;  (b) this Act or the Telecommunications Act 1997;  (c) one or more disallowable instruments under this Act (other than regulations under subsection (2)) or the Telecommunications Act 1997; have the effect of providing a scheme to give benefits of a kind mentioned in subsection (2)." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (6A) However, subsection (6) does not apply if obligations arising under one or any combination of the following:  (a) one or more agreements;  (b) this Act or the Telecommunications Act 1997;  (c) one or more disallowable instruments under this Act (other than regulations under subsection (2)) or the Telecommunications Act 1997; have the effect of providing a scheme to give benefits of a kind mentioned in subsection (2)."@en ;
