    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Items 3 to 6 of this Schedule apply if section 215 of the former law prevents a payment being made out of the Universal Service Account for the 1998-1999 financial year because of either or both of the following:  (a) the ACA has not yet made a written assessment under section 193 of the former law for that year;  (b) not all participating carriers in respect of which levy was assessed have paid the levy. Note: The operation of the former law for the 1998-1999 financial year is preserved by item 23 of Schedule 4 to the Telecommunications Legislation Amendment Act 1999." ;
