concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-4-sec-110 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "110 Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-110 ;
    values:originalText "(No. 2) 2000       No. 142, 2000 (3) A determination under subitem (2) is a disallowable instrument for the purposes of section 46A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901. (4) A carrier’s levy credit balance for the 1998-1999 financial year is reduced by the amount (worked out under this item) that is paid to the carrier. (5) This item continues to apply until each carrier’s levy credit balance for the year is reduced to nil.  Levy distribution for the 1999-2000 financial year  Schedule 5  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            111" ;
    skos:definition "(No. 2) 2000       No. 142, 2000 (3) A determination under subitem (2) is a disallowable instrument for the purposes of section 46A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901. (4) A carrier’s levy credit balance for the 1998-1999 financial year is reduced by the amount (worked out under this item) that is paid to the carrier. (5) This item continues to apply until each carrier’s levy credit balance for the year is reduced to nil.  Levy distribution for the 1999-2000 financial year  Schedule 5  Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000 No. 142, 2000            111"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e200a79599ebea480aab3fcfe839123295a6d837002512f77f2df5f91bb850e4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "114"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Reduces carrier's levy credit balance by amount paid to the carrier." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.114" ;
